+MATHEMATICAL JUDGMENT
+Each top-level conjunct is a nontrivial translation of exactly one relevant
+domain lemma.  The `True` nested in conjunct 1 is the exact image of
+`#Ceil(@V)` for a variable already typed as `SortVal`; it neither adds a new
